{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:49dbe6283df0409a","name":"Disruptor Pistol","source":{"id":"source:reference-49dbe6283df0409a","title":"Disruptor Pistol","revision":26718,"timestamp":"2025-07-02T22:38:08Z","sha256":"2842c59ae62c12fdf862abf5d86d25fb0105a8cbaf0852f3cde2c4a606d134dc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26718","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Disruptor%20Pistol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-49dbe6283df0409a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The DX-2 is a Disruptor Pistol built by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Tenloss Syndicate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Tenloss_Syndicate","referenceId":"reference:64be5d4d50be1387"},". It is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"}," on most worlds and firmly outlawed by the Empire (despite its use by some Imperial Special Forces). Designed to disintegrate what it hits, the DX-2 Disruptor Pistol tears apart targets on a molecular level, leaving gaping wounds when it does not totally eliminate a target. Used by some criminals and thugs, the DX-2 Disruptor Pistol actually became more popular shortly after the end of the Clone Wars.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Many shadowy figures think that if they are going to carry a weapon in defiance of Imperial law, they might as well carry a highly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"}," one- and besides, it's often useful not to leave bodies behind as evidence. Despite this, Disruptor Weapons remain a sign of cruelty and brutality not permitted in many societies, including some criminal organizations.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a Disruptor Weapon, the Disruptor Pistol treats all targets as if their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," was 5 points lower than it is. If damage from the Disruptor Pistol kills or destroys a target, that target is disintegrated and ceases to exist. Because of the massive energy required to create a Disruptor beam, the Disruptor Pistol can fire only once every other round. You cannot use any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"},", or other special ability that consumes more than one shot from the weapon per round (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"},") with a Disruptor Pistol.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Disruptor Pistol requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 10 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be recharged.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot (see above)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
